      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你想坐这台全息传送梯？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F6060F357508FD953F05168606F4F20900168AFFF1F00100002011401550000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "抱歉啊！这里正在施工呢。\n而且现在是休息时间。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62B16B49554AFF018FD991CC6B63572865BD5DE554623002000A800C4E1473B05728662F4F11606F65F695F4300200100002011401550000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啊，对了，\n要不要和我来场宝可梦对战？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "554AFF0C5BF94E86FF0C000A89814E0D8981548C62116765573A5B9D53EF68A65BF96218FF1F00100002011401550000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你要是愿意对战，我就结束休息！\n然后麻利地把活干完。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F608981662F613F610F5BF96218FF0C62115C317ED3675F4F11606FFF01000A7136540E9EBB52295730628A6D3B5E725B8C300200100002011401550000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要和我打宝可梦对战就来说一声。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981548C621162535B9D53EF68A65BF962185C3167658BF44E0058F0300200100002011401550000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你要是愿意和我打宝可梦对战，\n我就麻利地把活干完。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F608981662F613F610F548C621162535B9D53EF68A65BF96218FF0C000A62115C319EBB52295730628A6D3B5E725B8C300200100002011401550000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我会麻利地打赢！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
