      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那么，我要麻利地把活干完咯！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A34E48FF0C621189819EBB52295730628A6D3B5E725B8C54AFFF0100100002011401550000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "施工完毕！\n全息传送梯可以用啦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "65BD5DE55B8C6BD5FF01000A5168606F4F20900168AF53EF4EE575285566300200100002011401550000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "对了，刚才我派出的宝可梦\n全都是在屋顶上捉到的哦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BF94E86FF0C521A624D62116D3E51FA76845B9D53EF68A6000A516890FD662F57285C4B98764E0A63495230768454E6300200100002011401550000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "当然是在工作时间捉的！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n不过我太沉迷了，\n回过神来就到了休息时间。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F537136662F57285DE54F5C65F695F463497684FF0100100001BE01000A4E0D8FC76211592A6C898FF74E86FF0C000A56DE8FC7795E67655C3152304E864F11606F65F695F4300200100002011401550000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "总之，在屋顶能找到\n各种各样的宝可梦。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n你也找找看咯。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "603B4E4BFF0C57285C4B987680FD627E5230000A540479CD5404683776845B9D53EF68A6300200100001BE00000A4F604E5F627E627E770B54AF300200100002011401550000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我可是为了你\n麻利地把活干完了！没错吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
